# HABIT HERO - ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE

# Deploy your Google Apps Script as a Web App (execute as Me, access Everyone)
# Then copy the URL and paste it here:
VITE_API_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx/exec

# Optional: Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web Application / SPA)
# Create in Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
# Required for live Google Calendar & Google Tasks synchronization
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com

# NOTE ON AI ASSISTANT / GEMINI API SECURITY:
# GEMINI_API_KEY MUST NEVER BE PLACED HERE OR EXPOSED TO THE BROWSER CLIENT BUNDLE.
# It is configured strictly on the server-side inside Google Apps Script:
# Open Google Apps Script Editor -> Project Settings -> Script Properties -> Add 'GEMINI_API_KEY'
# When GEMINI_API_KEY is not set, the app transparently uses deterministic fallback heuristics.

